#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:31
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:85
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:96
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:107
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:178
msgid "**Log message**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:37
msgid ""
"**Cause**: The `PLATFORM` env var is required for building UCM. Without "
"it, the build defaults to `simu` (simulation mode) which is only for CI "
"testing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:39
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:51
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:78
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:127
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:140
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:153
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:165
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:185
#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:207
msgid "**Solution**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:47
msgid "Build fails with CMake errors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:49
msgid ""
"**Cause**: Missing build dependencies (`cmake`, `gcc`, or CUDA toolkit "
"not in path)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:52
msgid "Ensure `cmake >= 3.18` is installed: `cmake --version`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid ""
"Ensure the CUDA toolkit is installed and `nvcc` is accessible: `nvcc "
"--version`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:54
msgid "For Ascend, ensure the CANN toolkit is properly installed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:56
msgid "`pip install` fails with wheel build errors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:58
msgid ""
"**Cause**: Building C++ extensions requires a proper compiler "
"environment. On some systems, `--no-build-isolation` may fail if the "
"build toolchain is not set up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting-started/troubleshooting.md:60
msgid ""
"**Solution**: Use the pre-built Docker image or wheel package from "
"[PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/uc-manager/) instead."
msgstr ""

